### Jobs API walkthrough
### Requires: supython up && supython dev

### Enqueue a job (service_role JWT required)
POST http://localhost:8000/jobs/v1/enqueue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{service_role_token}}

{
    "name": "send_welcome_email",
    "payload": {"user_id": "some-uuid"},
    "queue": "default",
    "max_attempts": 5
}

### List all jobs
GET http://localhost:8000/jobs/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{service_role_token}}

### Get a specific job
GET http://localhost:8000/jobs/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service_role_token}}

### Cancel a job
POST http://localhost:8000/jobs/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{service_role_token}}

### Retry a failed job
POST http://localhost:8000/jobs/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{service_role_token}}
